Cattle ranching is concentrated in the grasslands of [[Araucaria]] and the fertile valleys of [[Piedmont]]. The industry is characterized by extensive grazing systems with minimal use of feedlots, reflecting Baliscan preferences for animal welfare and environmental sustainability. Balisca is one of Abyala's leading beef exporters.

Dairy production is organized through cooperative creameries that process milk into cheese, butter, yogurt, and other products. Balisca is self-sufficient in dairy products and exports specialty cheeses.

